    "description": "Comprehensive enterprise Postman Collection for Certificate Deployment Manager (CDM). Includes automated assertions, environment variable chaining, operational REST APIs for Certificates, Target Servers, Replacements, Deployments, MID Servers, Audit Logs, Spring Boot Actuator diagnostics, and negative security tests.",
